<h2>September 20, 2006</h2>


<h1 id="a000130">For Now, I Walk Alone - Video</h1>

<p>DARWIN, AUSTRALIA - Gia left last night; back to the Gold Coast.   This is the first time, since leaving Toronto that I'm travelling on my own.   I'm not really sure what to do.   I guess I'll just concern myself with getting across the Timor Sea and up into Asia.   </p>

